    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίαρμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαίρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>passage by sea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.8.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Agathem.
				3.13
			</span></i>; <i>crossing of a channel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				4.5.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>elevation</i> of style, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγκος καὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.853c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				12.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ψυχῆς λαβεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					9.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούφισμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
